.blob/

# Eval-ops release-gate run artifacts (LP-22): the run-capability-evals /
# run-sota-validation CLIs emit dated `YYYY-MM-DD/` report dirs under
# Docs/parity-tests/*/results/ on every run. Those dated dirs are
# regenerated, not source — ignore them while keeping the results/ dir
# (its .gitkeep + the suite README) tracked.
Docs/parity-tests/*/results/20*/

